ttfx — terminal text effects, compiled to WebAssembly.

  https://github.com/omacom/ttfx

MIT licensed. ttfx is a Rust port of TerminalTextEffects by ChrisBuilds
(https://github.com/ChrisBuilds/terminaltexteffects), also MIT; both
copyrights are preserved in that repository's LICENSE and NOTICE.

Vendored here unmodified (ttfx.js, ttfx.d.ts and the all.wasm effects
build) so the wordmark can be drawn by the same engine omarchy.org uses.
Loaded lazily, only when someone clicks the wordmark.
